OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud. Some
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells breaking
OL,8,Fthrough at times. Light winds. Feeling
OL,9,Fwarm in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,14,Fsome clear periods. Light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,17,Fwith some good spells of sunshine.
OL,18,FFeeling warm, but a cooler onshore
OL,19,Fbreeze along the east coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
